Here is the code with added reasoning. It implements cybersecurity checks for operator commands (IEC 62443), handles hot-standby PLC failover through a heartbeat monitor, and maps data cleanly to a SCADA interface.

TYPE "udt_SCADA_IF"
   STRUCT
      Cmd_AutoMode : Bool;
      Cmd_Override : Bool;
      OperatorToken : DWord;
