FUNCTION_BLOCK FB_AdvancedBiopharma_MammalianBioreactorControl
(*
    =============================================================================
    BLOCK NAME: FB_AdvancedBiopharma_MammalianBioreactorControl
    AUTHOR: 40-year Veteran Automation Architect
    SYSTEM: 2000L Mammalian Cell Culture Perfusion Bioreactor
    DESCRIPTION:
