Here is the advanced Siemens SCL program that introduces dynamic secondary cooling spray control based on casting speed and steel grade.

FUNCTION_BLOCK "CC_Control_With_Cooling"
VERSION : 0.2
   VAR_INPUT
      Start_Cast : Bool;
      Stop_Cast : Bool;
      Mould_Level_Raw : Real;
      Casting_Speed : Real; 
      Thermocouple_Grid : Array[1..20] of Real;
      Steel_Grade_ID : Int; // 1 = Low Carbon, 2 = High Carbon
