(*
=================================================================================================
    FB_Hydrothermal_ROV
    Description: Abyssal Hydrothermal Vent Extremophile Harvesting ROV & Biomass Chemostat
    Institute:   Deep-Ocean Biology Institute
    Author:      Chief Robotics Engineer
