// Description:
// Highly complex production-ready controller for a Bayer Process Bauxite Digester.
// Integrates:
// 1. NaOH concentration management based on Bauxite Silica Content.
// 2. High-pressure control logic (up to 40 bar).
// 3. Flash Tank Cascade Heat Recovery Sequencing (multiple stages).
